<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-060" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-060-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-060-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-060-appraisal:line102" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　評曰：山越好為叛亂，難安易動，是以<persName id="c-sanguozhi-060-appraisal:line102:m0019" ref="572_278_cba">孫權</persName>不遑外御，卑詞魏氏。凡此諸臣，皆克寧內難，綏靜邦域者也。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-060-appraisal:line102:m0049" ref="2oe_qam_pq4">呂岱</persName>清恪在公；<persName id="c-sanguozhi-060-appraisal:line102:m0056" ref="iuc_mqu_3jm">周魴</persName>譎略多奇；<persName id="c-sanguozhi-060-appraisal:line102:m0063" ref="2ue_nmk_m3s_A">鐘離牧</persName>蹈長者之規；<persName id="c-sanguozhi-060-appraisal:line102:m0072" ref="984_9e1_5e9">全琮</persName>有當世之才，貴重於時，然不檢姦子，獲譏毀名云。</p>
</text>
